// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 4
window.T4_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"agriculture – box office","cards":[{"w":"agriculture","p":"n.","d":"the science, practice, or occupation of farming and cultivating soil","c":"農業；農藝（不可數）","s":"The fertile river valley has always been an ideal region for agriculture and food production.","t":"這座肥沃的河谷一直以來都是從事農業與糧食生產的理想地區。"},{"w":"agricultural","p":"adj.","d":"relating to farming, crops, or the cultivation of the land","c":"農業的；農產的","s":"The local government built irrigation canals to protect surrounding agricultural land from severe seasonal drought.","t":"當地政府修建灌溉運河，以保護周邊的農業用地免受嚴重的季節性乾旱侵害。"},{"w":"beam","p":"n.","d":"a ray or shaft of light; a long sturdy piece of timber or metal supporting a roof","c":"光線；光束；（房屋）橫梁","s":"The lighthouse projected a bright beam of light across the stormy waters to guide ships safely.","t":"燈塔在暴風雨的水面上投射出一道明亮的光線／光束，以引導船隻安全航行。"},{"w":"beam","p":"v.","d":"to shine brightly; to smile broadly with radiant joy","c":"照射；發光；眉開眼笑；露出笑容","s":"The proud parents could not help but beam with joy as their daughter received her graduation diploma.","t":"當看見女兒領取畢業證書時，引以為傲的父母禁不住眉開眼笑／笑逐顏開。"},{"w":"bore","p":"v.","d":"to make someone feel weary, impatient, or unexcited by tedious talk","c":"使厭煩；使感到無聊（動詞）","s":"Please stop talking about your daily office gossip because you will only bore everyone at the dinner table.","t":"請不要再談論你日常的辦公室八卦，因為你只會使餐桌上的所有人感到厭煩。"},{"w":"bore","p":"n.","d":"a dull, uninteresting, or tiresome person or thing","c":"令人厭煩的人；討厭無趣的事物","s":"Nobody likes to sit beside him during train rides because he is such a talkative and complaining bore.","t":"搭火車時沒有人喜歡坐在他旁邊，因為他真是個愛嘮叨抱怨的討厭鬼／悶蛋。"},{"w":"bored","p":"adj.","d":"feeling weary, unexcited, and restless through lack of interest","c":"感到無聊的；感到厭煩的","s":"After watching television programs for three straight hours, the young boy became thoroughly bored and went outdoors.","t":"連續看了三個小時的電視節目後，那個小男孩變得徹底感到無聊並走到了戶外。"},{"w":"boring","p":"adj.","d":"not interesting; tedious and tiresome","c":"乏味的；無聊的；令人生厭的","s":"Most of the audience members fell asleep during the third hour of the long and boring political speech.","t":"在長達三個小時且乏味無趣的政治演講中，大部分的聽眾都睡著了。"},{"w":"bunch","p":"n.","d":"a number of things grouped together; a group of people; a large amount","c":"一束；一串；一群（人）；大量","s":"David bought a sweet bunch of purple grapes and washed them thoroughly for his little sister.","t":"大衛買了一串香甜的紫葡萄，並為他妹妹徹底清洗乾淨。"},{"w":"bundle","p":"n.","d":"a collection of things tied or wrapped together in a package","c":"一捆；一包；大堆","s":"The diligent volunteer carried a heavy bundle of recycled newspapers out to the neighborhood collection truck.","t":"那位勤奮的志工將一捆沉重的回收報紙搬運到社區回收車上。"},{"w":"bundle","p":"v.","d":"to tie, wrap, or package things together into a bundle","c":"捆紮；包裝（動詞）","s":"The workers had to bundle all the loose electrical cables together to prevent office tripping hazards.","t":"工人們必須將所有散落的電線捆紮在一起，以防止辦公室絆倒危險。"},{"w":"bundle up","p":"v.phr.","d":"to dress warmly in many layers of clothing against the cold","c":"穿得暖和；穿厚厚的衣服","s":"Before the children ran outside into the freezing blizzard, their loving mother told them to bundle up.","t":"在孩子們跑到室外冰凍的暴風雪之前，慈愛的母親囑咐他們要穿得暖和。"},{"w":"bush","p":"n.","d":"a woody plant smaller than a tree, with multiple stems growing from the base","c":"灌木；灌木叢","s":"The gardener used a sharp pair of hedge shears to trim the tall green bushes along the driveway.","t":"園丁使用一把鋒利的綠籬剪修剪車道旁高聳的綠色灌木叢。"},{"w":"beat around the bush","p":"v.phr.","d":"to discuss a matter without coming directly to the main point","c":"說話拐彎抹角；旁敲側擊","s":"Please tell me the honest truth about your test results and do not beat around the bush anymore.","t":"請如實告訴我你的考試成績，不要再拐彎抹角了。"},{"w":"cigarette","p":"n.","d":"a small cylinder of finely cut tobacco rolled in paper for smoking","c":"香菸；紙菸","s":"Public health laws strictly prohibit people from smoking a cigarette inside hospitals, train stations, and restaurants.","t":"公共衛生法嚴格禁止人們在醫院、火車站與餐廳內吸香菸。"},{"w":"tobacco","p":"n.","d":"the prepared dried leaves of a plant used for smoking or chewing","c":"菸草；菸草製品（不可數）","s":"The farmer dedicated three large sunny fields to cultivating golden Virginia tobacco for export.","t":"那位農民劃出三塊向陽大農田種植金色維吉尼亞菸草以供出口。"},{"w":"cigar","p":"n.","d":"a roll of dried tobacco leaves wrapped in another leaf for smoking","c":"雪茄","s":"After finishing the luxurious business dinner, the wealthy investor lit an expensive imported Cuban cigar.","t":"享用完奢華的商務晚宴後，那位富有的投資人點燃了一支昂貴的進口古巴雪茄。"},{"w":"cinema","p":"n.","d":"a movie theater, or the production of movies as an art form or industry","c":"電影院；電影藝術；電影業","s":"On rainy Saturday afternoons, Jason and his friends love to go to the local cinema to watch the latest films.","t":"在下雨的星期六下午，傑森和他的朋友們喜歡去當地的電影院觀看最新電影。"},{"w":"box office","p":"n.phr.","d":"the place at a theater where tickets are bought; the commercial success of a movie","c":"售票處；（電影等）票房","s":"You can pick up your reserved cinema tickets directly at the box office two hours before the screening starts.","t":"你可以在放映開始前兩小時直接在售票處領取你預約的電影票。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"citizen – geographical","cards":[{"w":"citizen","p":"n.","d":"a legally recognized subject or national of a state or commonwealth","c":"公民；國民；市民（可數）","s":"Every adult citizen in this democratic nation has the constitutional right and duty to vote.","t":"在這個民主國家中，每位成年公民都擁有投票的憲法權利與義務。"},{"w":"citizenship","p":"n.","d":"the position or status of being a citizen of a particular country","c":"公民身分；公民權（不可數）","s":"After living legally and working productively in Canada for five years, Maria decided to apply for citizenship.","t":"在加拿大合法居留並辛勤工作五年後，瑪麗亞決定申請公民身分。"},{"w":"closet","p":"n.","d":"a small room or large tall cupboard used for storing clothes and personal items","c":"衣櫥；壁櫥；儲藏室（可數）","s":"Before the autumn season arrived, Carrie thoroughly cleaned out her bedroom closet and donated old winter jackets.","t":"在秋季來臨之前，凱莉徹底清理了她的臥室衣櫥，並捐贈了舊冬裝夾克。"},{"w":"dam","p":"n.","d":"a barrier constructed across a river to hold back water and raise its level","c":"水壩；水閘（可數）","s":"The government built a massive hydroelectric dam across the deep mountain canyon to generate clean electricity.","t":"政府在深邃的山谷中建造了一座巨大的水力發電水壩來產生潔淨電力。"},{"w":"dam","p":"v.","d":"to build a dam across a river or stream to stop the flow of water","c":"築壩阻擋；攔截（河流）（動詞）","s":"Engineers decided to dam the rushing river in order to create a reliable fresh water reservoir.","t":"工程師們決定築壩截斷那條湍急的河流，以建造一個可靠的淡水水庫。"},{"w":"dock","p":"n.","d":"a structure extending along or out from the shore where ships can load and unload","c":"碼頭；船塢；裝卸區（可數）","s":"Betty waited anxiously on the wooden dock for her father's commercial fishing vessel to return safely.","t":"貝蒂焦急地在木製碼頭上等待父親的商業漁船安全歸來。"},{"w":"dock","p":"v.","d":"to bring a ship or boat into a dock; to deduct money from someone's wages","c":"（船隻）靠岸；停泊碼頭；扣除（工資）","s":"The strict manager warned the late employee that arriving tardy again would dock his monthly wages.","t":"嚴格的經理警告那名遲到的員工，如果再次遲到將會扣除他的月薪。"},{"w":"exchange","p":"n.","d":"an act of giving one thing and receiving another in return; a short conversation","c":"交換；交流；匯兌（可數/不可數）","s":"The lively exchange of creative views at the international conference led to dozens of groundbreaking business ideas.","t":"在國際會議上熱烈的創意觀點交流激發了數十個突破性的商業點子。"},{"w":"exchange","p":"v.","d":"to give something and receive something of equivalent value in return","c":"交換；調換；兌換（動詞）","s":"Before traveling abroad to Tokyo for vacation, we went to the bank to exchange local currency for Japanese yen.","t":"在出國前往東京度假之前，我們前往銀行將本國貨幣兌換成日圓。"},{"w":"exchange student","p":"n.phr.","d":"a student who studies abroad at a partner school or university for a period","c":"交換學生","s":"Our family enjoyed the delightful experience of hosting a high school exchange student from Germany for a semester.","t":"我們全家非常享受接待一名來自德國的高中交換學生長達一個學期的愉快經歷。"},{"w":"flute","p":"n.","d":"a high-pitched wind instrument consisting of a tube with holes stopped by fingers or keys","c":"長笛；笛子（可數）","s":"The talented young musician has practiced playing the classical silver flute diligently since she was seven years old.","t":"那位才華洋溢的年輕音樂家自七歲起便勤奮練習吹奏古典銀長笛。"},{"w":"garage","p":"n.","d":"a building or shed for housing motor vehicles; a repair shop for cars","c":"車庫；修車廠（可數）","s":"The mechanic at the local auto repair garage called to say that our brakes had been completely fixed.","t":"當地汽車維修廠的技師打電話來說我們的煞車系統已經完全修復了。"},{"w":"garage sale","p":"n.phr.","d":"a sale of miscellaneous secondhand household items held in the garage or front yard","c":"車庫拍賣；二手雜物出清拍賣","s":"Before moving across the country next month, the Miller family held a massive weekend garage sale in their front driveway.","t":"在下個月搬遷到全國另一端之前，米勒一家人在前車道舉辦了一場盛大的週末車庫拍賣。"},{"w":"geography","p":"n.","d":"the study of the physical features of the earth, its atmosphere, and human activity","c":"地理學；地形；地理分佈（不可數）","s":"During our junior high school geography lesson, we examined colorful topographic maps of volcanoes across the Pacific.","t":"在我們的國中地理課上，我們仔細研究了太平洋各火山的多彩地形圖。"},{"w":"geographical","p":"adj.","d":"based on or derived from the physical features of an area","c":"地理學的；地理特徵的","s":"The port city enjoys an exceptionally favorable geographical location with direct maritime access to international trading routes.","t":"這座港口城市享有極佳的地理位置，可直接透過海路通達國際貿易航線。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"glance – odd","cards":[{"w":"glance","p":"v.","d":"to take a brief or hurried look at someone or something","c":"瞥一眼；匆匆一瞥（動詞）","s":"The impatient student nervously glanced at the classroom wall clock, eager for the bell to ring.","t":"那名不耐煩的學生緊張地瞥了一眼教室掛鐘，急切盼望下課鐘聲響起。"},{"w":"glance","p":"n.","d":"a brief or hurried look","c":"一瞥；短暫的注視（可數）","s":"The busy doctor cast a quick glance at the medical chart before greeting the patient.","t":"忙碌的醫生在向病人問診前，匆匆看了一眼病歷表。"},{"w":"at first glance","p":"phr.","d":"when first examined or considered, before closer inspection","c":"乍看之下；初看時","s":"At first glance, the green walking stick insect looked exactly like a small wooden tree twig.","t":"乍看之下，那隻綠色的竹節蟲看起來就像是一根小木樹枝。"},{"w":"hollow","p":"adj.","d":"having a hole or empty space inside; not solid","c":"空心的；中空的；虛偽空洞的","s":"A family of cheerful brown squirrels built their warm winter nest inside a large hollow tree trunk.","t":"一群開朗的棕色松鼠在一個巨大的中空／空心樹幹內築起了溫暖的冬巢。"},{"w":"hollow","p":"n.","d":"a hole or depression in a surface; a small valley or basin between hills","c":"窪地；山谷；穴（可數）","s":"My grandfather owns a peaceful organic apple farm situated in a fertile hollow surrounded by rolling green hills.","t":"我祖父在一個被起伏綠色山丘環繞的肥沃窪地／山谷中擁有一座幽靜的有機蘋果農場。"},{"w":"hollow out","p":"v.phr.","d":"to remove the inner part of something to make it empty inside","c":"挖空；挖成中空","s":"Every October before Halloween, American children love to hollow out large orange pumpkins to create glowing lanterns.","t":"每年十月萬聖節前夕，美國孩童喜歡挖空大橘色南瓜來製作發光的南瓜燈籠。"},{"w":"intelligent","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing great mental capacity, quick intelligence, or wisdom","c":"聰明的；有才智的；明智的","s":"Marine biologists agree that dolphins are remarkably intelligent mammals capable of complex communication and teamwork.","t":"海洋生物學家一致認為海豚是極具智慧聰明的哺乳動物，能夠進行複雜的溝通與團隊協作。"},{"w":"intelligence","p":"n.","d":"the ability to acquire and apply knowledge; secret military or security information","c":"智力；聰明才智；情報（不可數）","s":"The national security agency gathered vital secret intelligence to protect the country from potential cyber terror attacks.","t":"國家安全局蒐集了至關重要的秘密情報，以保護國家免受潛在的網路恐怖襲擊。"},{"w":"kindergarten","p":"n.","d":"an educational establishment or class for children before they begin primary school","c":"幼兒園；幼稚園（可數/不可數）","s":"Leah is turning four years old this autumn, so her excited parents enrolled her in a friendly neighborhood kindergarten.","t":"莉亞今年秋天就要滿四歲了，因此她興奮的父母為她報名了住家附近一所友善的幼兒園。"},{"w":"kindergartener","p":"n.","d":"a child who attends a kindergarten","c":"幼兒園學童","s":"The cheerful kindergartener wore a tiny yellow backpack and walked proudly toward the classroom holding her mother's hand.","t":"那個活潑的幼兒園學童背著一個黃色小書包，牽著媽媽的手自豪地走向教室。"},{"w":"marble","p":"n.","d":"a hard crystalline rock used in sculpture and architecture; a small glass toy ball","c":"大理石（不可數）；彈珠（可數）","s":"The grand palace foyer featured a magnificent polished marble staircase that dazzled visiting foreign dignitaries.","t":"這座宏偉宮殿的門廳配有一座光彩奪目的拋光大理石樓梯，讓造訪的外國貴賓讚嘆不已。"},{"w":"melon","p":"n.","d":"the large round fruit of various plants, with sweet watery flesh","c":"甜瓜；瓜類水果（可數）","s":"Nothing tastes more refreshing on a sweltering summer afternoon than a chilled slice of sweet juicy melon.","t":"在酷熱的夏日午後，沒有什麼比吃一片冰鎮香甜且多汁的甜瓜／西瓜更令人身心舒暢了。"},{"w":"minus","p":"prep.","d":"with the subtraction of; minus; below zero on a temperature scale","c":"減去；負（介系詞）","s":"The elementary math test asked students to calculate seventy minus twenty-five without using an electronic calculator.","t":"這份國小數學測驗要求學生在不使用電子計算機的情況下計算七十減去二十五。"},{"w":"minus","p":"n.","d":"a disadvantage; the minus sign (-)","c":"缺點；負數；減號（可數）","s":"Living far away from the subway station is certainly a major minus for this otherwise charming apartment.","t":"離捷運站太遠對於這間其他方面都很迷人的公寓而言，確實是一大缺點。"},{"w":"odd","p":"adj.","d":"strange or unusual; (of whole numbers) not divisible by two","c":"奇怪的；奇數的；零星奇特的","s":"The car engine began to make an extremely odd clicking sound that worried the experienced driver.","t":"汽車引擎開始發出一種極其奇怪的喀喀聲，讓經驗豐富的駕駛人感到憂心。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"passenger – romantic","cards":[{"w":"passenger","p":"n.","d":"a traveler on a public or private conveyance other than the driver or crew","c":"乘客；旅客（可數）","s":"The flight attendant kindly reminded each seated passenger to fasten their seatbelts before takeoff.","t":"空服員親切地提醒每一位就座的乘客在起飛前繫緊安全帶。"},{"w":"pole","p":"n.","d":"a long, slender, rounded piece of wood or metal; either of the earth's axis ends","c":"桿子；柱子；極點（可數）","s":"Every Monday morning, the school principal raises the national flag to the top of the tall pole.","t":"每週一早晨，校長都會將國旗升到高大旗桿的頂端。"},{"w":"political","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the government or the public affairs of a country","c":"政治的；政黨的","s":"Tom and his father often disagree about national policies because they support completely different political parties.","t":"湯姆和他父親經常對國家政策意見不合，因為他們支持完全不同的政黨。"},{"w":"politician","p":"n.","d":"a person who is professionally involved in politics, especially as an elected official","c":"從政者；政客；政治人物（可數）","s":"Voters were disappointed when the newly elected politician failed to fulfill his key campaign promises.","t":"當新當選的政客／政治人物未能兌現關鍵競選承諾時，選民們感到很失望。"},{"w":"politics","p":"n.","d":"the activities associated with the governance of a country or area","c":"政治；政治事務（不可數，常作單數）","s":"After practicing corporate law for fifteen years, Sarah decided to enter national politics to fight for civil rights.","t":"在從事公司法律業務十五年後，莎拉決定步入國家政壇／政治為公民權利而奮鬥。"},{"w":"rank","p":"n.","d":"a position in the hierarchy of the armed forces or an organization; high social standing","c":"軍階；階級；地位（可數/不可數）","s":"After serving bravely in the army for seven years, James rose in rank to become a respected captain.","t":"在軍隊英勇服役七年後，詹姆士晉升了軍階／階級成為一名備受尊敬的上尉。"},{"w":"rank","p":"v.","d":"to give someone or something a rank or place in a graded hierarchy","c":"評定等級；名列；排列名次（動詞）","s":"Because Kelly studied exceptionally hard throughout the semester, she was ranked first in her graduating class.","t":"因為凱莉整個學期都極為用功，她在畢業班中排名第一。"},{"w":"resist","p":"v.","d":"to withstand the action or effect of; to refrain from doing something tempting","c":"抵抗；耐（高溫/酸）；抵擋（誘惑）（動詞）","s":"This newly developed aerospace alloy is engineered to resist extreme heat during atmospheric reentry.","t":"這種新研發的航空合金經過專門設計，能夠在重返大氣層時承受／耐極端高溫。"},{"w":"resistance","p":"n.","d":"the refusal to accept or comply with something; the ability not to be affected by disease","c":"抵抗；抗拒；抗藥性；免疫力（不可數）","s":"Eating fresh fruits and exercising outdoors helps your body build up natural resistance against common winter colds.","t":"食用新鮮水果和在戶外運動有助於你的身體建立對常見冬季感冒的天然抵抗力。"},{"w":"response","p":"n.","d":"a verbal or written answer; a reaction to something","c":"回答；回應；反應（可數/不可數）","s":"The university customer service team promised to send a detailed written response to my email within twenty-four hours.","t":"該大學客戶服務團隊承諾在二十四小時內對我的電子郵件發送詳細的書面回覆。"},{"w":"respond","p":"v.","d":"to say something in reply; to act in reaction to something","c":"回答；做出反應（動詞）","s":"The company representative promised to respond to all customer inquiries before the end of the business day.","t":"公司代表承諾在營業日結束前回覆回答所有顧客的詢問。"},{"w":"risk","p":"n.","d":"a situation involving exposure to danger, harm, or financial loss","c":"危險；風險（可數/不可數）","s":"Investing all your retirement savings into a single volatile technology stock involves a tremendous financial risk.","t":"將你所有的退休積蓄投資於單一波動較大的科技股票伴隨著巨大的財務風險。"},{"w":"risk","p":"v.","d":"to expose to danger or loss; to act in a hazardous way","c":"冒著…的危險；以…做賭注（動詞）","s":"You should never risk driving home after drinking alcohol because you could harm yourself and others.","t":"你絕不應該冒著…的危險酒後駕車回家，因為這會傷害你自己和他人。"},{"w":"risky","p":"adj.","d":"full of the possibility of danger, failure, or loss","c":"危險的；冒險的；充滿風險的","s":"Driving down the steep mountain highway during a torrential midnight rainstorm is an extremely risky journey.","t":"在傾盆豪雨的午夜開車下陡峭的山區公路是一趟極其危險冒險的旅程。"},{"w":"romantic","p":"adj.","d":"relating to, conducive to, or suggestive of love and romance","c":"浪漫的；多情的","s":"The loving couple celebrated their fifth wedding anniversary with a candlelit romantic dinner beside the quiet beach.","t":"這對相愛的夫妻在幽靜的海灘旁享用了一頓燭光浪漫晚餐，以慶祝他們的五週年結婚紀念日。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"scholar – territory","cards":[{"w":"scholar","p":"n.","d":"a specialist in a particular branch of study; a distinguished academic","c":"學者；學術研究者（可數）","s":"The respected ancient scholar Confucius taught profound lessons about moral honor, family filial piety, and civic virtue.","t":"受人尊敬的古代學者孔子講授了關於道德榮譽、家庭孝道與公民美德的深刻教誨。"},{"w":"scholarship","p":"n.","d":"a grant or payment made to support a student's education; academic study","c":"獎學金；學術成就（可數/不可數）","s":"Because of her exceptional performance in high school athletics, Ann was awarded a full college sports scholarship.","t":"由於她在高中體育競賽中的傑出表現，安獲頒了大學全額體育獎學金。"},{"w":"separation","p":"n.","d":"the action or state of moving or being moved apart; division","c":"分開；分離；分居；隔離（可數/不可數）","s":"The constitution guarantees a clear separation of powers among the legislative, executive, and judicial government branches.","t":"憲法保障立法、行政與司法政府部門之間明確的分立／分權。"},{"w":"separate","p":"v.","d":"to cause to move or be apart; to divide into constituent parts","c":"分隔；分開；使分離（動詞）","s":"The kindergarten teacher gently separated the two arguing children and asked them to play peacefully.","t":"幼兒園老師輕輕地把兩個爭吵的孩子分開，並要求他們和睦玩耍。"},{"w":"separate","p":"adj.","d":"forming or viewed as a unit by itself; distinct","c":"分開的；各自的；獨立的","s":"The twin brothers decided it was time to sleep in separate bedrooms as they grew into teenagers.","t":"這對雙胞胎兄弟隨著成長為青少年，決定是時候睡在各自獨立的臥室裡了。"},{"w":"spin","p":"v.","d":"to turn or cause to turn around rapidly on an axis; to draw out and twist fibers into yarn","c":"旋轉；紡紗；紡織（動詞）","s":"The graceful ice skater began to spin rapidly on one foot in the center of the rink.","t":"那位優雅的花式滑冰運動員開始在溜冰場中央單腳快速旋轉。"},{"w":"spin","p":"n.","d":"a rapid turning movement; a brief drive in a motor vehicle for pleasure","c":"旋轉；兜風（可數）","s":"George proudly invited his best friend to hop into his shiny convertible and take it for a spin down the coast.","t":"喬治自豪地邀請摯友跳上他閃亮的敞篷車，沿著海岸兜風一圈。"},{"w":"sufficient","p":"adj.","d":"enough; adequate for the purpose or need","c":"充足的；足夠的","s":"The emergency relief organization delivered sufficient food and clean bottled water to supply the refugee camp for months.","t":"緊急救援組織運送了充足的糧食與乾淨瓶裝水，足以供應難民營數月之久。"},{"w":"self-sufficient","p":"adj.","d":"needing no outside help in satisfying one's basic needs","c":"自給自足的；獨立自主的","s":"By installing rooftop solar panels and growing organic vegetables, the eco-friendly family became completely self-sufficient in energy and food.","t":"透過安裝屋頂太陽能板與種植有機蔬菜，這個環保家庭在能源與糧食上達到了完全自給自足。"},{"w":"tank","p":"n.","d":"a large container for holding liquid or gas; a heavy armored military combat vehicle","c":"大水槽；油箱；坦克車（可數）","s":"Before embarking on our long road trip across the desert, Dad pulled into the station to fill up the car's fuel tank.","t":"在踏上穿越沙漠的長途公路旅行之前，爸爸把車開進加油站把車子的油箱加滿。"},{"w":"temper","p":"n.","d":"a person's state of mind seen in terms of their being angry or calm","c":"脾氣；情緒（可數/不可數）","s":"Although Mr. Harris is usually patient, he completely lost his temper when the careless driver crashed into his mailbox.","t":"雖然哈里斯先生平時很有耐心，但當粗心的駕駛人撞壞他的信箱時，他完全發了脾氣／大發雷霆。"},{"w":"territory","p":"n.","d":"an area of land under the jurisdiction of a ruler or state; an area defended by an animal","c":"領土；領地；地盤；領域（可數/不可數）","s":"Fierce male wolves constantly patrol their forest boundaries and spray scent to mark their pack's territory.","t":"凶猛的公狼經常在森林邊界巡邏並噴灑氣味以標記狼群的領地／地盤。"}]}];
